      "Section": "Sync Pipelines via Batch Update",
      "Anchor": "sync-pipelines-via-batch-update",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Sync Pipelines via Batch Update"
      ],
      "Text": "Perform HTTP PUT on the /tcrmPipelines endpoint to send talent CRM pipelines to LinkedIn. Batch requests require the x-restli-method: batch_update header. Multiple records can be sent in a single API request as indicated in the example below.",
